と思ったんだが…お前に会うためだったか、「トゥマ{RUBY#[S]希望}イニ」。","nextNodeIds":[756610102]},{"nodeId":756610102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1092,"speakerName":"チャスカ","textMapHash":765876842,"text":"「花翼の集」の戦闘試験のために来たんだな？","nextNodeIds":[756610103,756610106]},{"nodeId":756610103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2356699162,"text":"うん、難易度を試すためにね。","nextNodeIds":[756610104]},{"nodeId":756610104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1092,"speakerName":"チャスカ","textMapHash":639708282,"text":"手応えを感じてもらえると思う。私はクク竜騎士の訓練には厳しいからな。","nextNodeIds":[756610105]},{"nodeId":756610105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1092,"speakerName":"チャスカ","textMapHash":2826506890,"text":"人に教えるのは得意じゃないから、設計にあたっては、これまでに遭遇した「厄介な問題」を思い浮かべて、ステージに組み込んだ。","nextNodeIds":[756610109]},{"nodeId":756610109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1092,"speakerName":"チャスカ","textMapHash":2564106250,"text":"だが、「花翼の集」の戦士の九割九分が第一ステージで脱落してしまってな。仕方なく、イラードの提案通り、難易度を下げたんだが…","nextNodeIds":[756610110]},{"nodeId":756610110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1092,"speakerName":"チャスカ","textMapHash":4008425018,"text":"お前なら、難易度を下げては物足りないだろう。そうだな…私でさえ手こずるステージを選ぶべきだ。","nextNodeIds":[756610111,756610112]},{"nodeId":756610111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":469877274,"text":"同感！でも、特別扱いは遠慮しとく…","nextNodeIds":[756610113]},{"nodeId":756610113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1092,"speakerName":"チャスカ","textMapHash":2470785026,"text":"買い被りなんかじゃない。教えるのは苦手だが、人の能力を見定める眼力には自信がある。","nextNodeIds":[756610114]},{"nodeId":756610114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1092,"speakerName":"チャスカ","textMapHash":2005060210,"text":"君の実力なら、一番難しい挑戦でも行けそうだが…","nextNodeIds":[756610115,756610116]},{"nodeId":756610115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3210697042,"text":"ほかの戦士のことも考えないと…","nextNodeIds":[756610117]},{"nodeId":756610117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1092,"speakerName":"チャスカ","textMapHash":2513348210,"text":"…そうだな。今回は依頼されたテストを優先しよう。","nextNodeIds":[756610118]},{"nodeId":756610118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1092,"speakerName":"チャスカ","textMapHash":36493666,"text":"代わりに今度、お前にぴったりな…クク竜騎士の頂点をも「超越」した戦闘の宴を用意するから、楽しみにしててくれ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":756610116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1513092986,"text":"普通の戦士にも使えるものじゃないと！","nextNodeIds":[756610117]},{"nodeId":756610112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":53012866,"text":"嬉しいけど、買い被りだよ。","nextNodeIds":[756610113]},{"nodeId":756610106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3441874882,"text":"チャスカに会うためでもあるよ。","nextNodeIds":[756610107]},{"nodeId":756610107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1092,"speakerName":"チャスカ","textMapHash":2167255906,"text":"ふっ、そうか…","nextNodeIds":[756610108]},{"nodeId":756610108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1092,"speakerName":"チャスカ","textMapHash":1700780618,"text":"——私の記録を「超越」することが狙いなんだろう？望むところだ。このステージには、私がこれまで遭遇してきた「厄介な問題」を組み込んである。","nextNodeIds":[756610109]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7566101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7566101],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1092,"speakerName":"チャスカ","count":12},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":6}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_